      "side": 1,
      "message": "We need bit 20 to be a part of BOARD_ALL_PROPERTIES if we want it to be available.\n\nFlags that are a part of BOARD_ALL_PROPERTIES are cleared after reset, so we can guarantee updates will clear the flag.\n\nIf someone adds a new flag in this position that\u0027s not a part of BOARD_ALL_PROPERTIES, then it could still be set to 1 because an old cr50 image set it.\n\nI think we should rename BOARD_ALLOW_CHANGE_TPM_MODE to BOARD_UNUSED, keep BOARD_UNUSED in BOARD_ALL_PROPERTIES, and add a comment. This was used, so it may be set to 1. Any new flag that uses bit 20 must be a part of BOARD_ALL_PROPERTIES to ensure any old flag settings are cleared after the cr50 update.",
